  "summary": "Run the canonical R PK/BE sandbox, residual-carryover and C-QTc operating-characteristic simulations, or all six stages of the fixed worked bioequivalence study directly in this browser. No local R installation, account or toolkit download is needed.",
  "data_scope": "Synthetic methods and fixed worked study",
  "data_note": "All data generated here are synthetic. The worked study deliberately reproduces its fixed educational assumptions; it is not an arbitrary client-study generator.",
  "usage_note": "Select a module, review its assumptions and confirm before running. Save the complete review ZIP before reloading. Larger simulation grids may take several minutes. The complete PK/BE sandbox includes an N=400 calibration diagnostic and may take about two minutes on a desktop browser.",
