    "Choose the PK/BE sandbox, review the simulation settings, confirm and run. Inspect the data, results, figures and retained warnings.",
    "Choose carryover or C-QTc to select scenarios and simulation precision. The complete outputs retain Monte Carlo uncertainty and method diagnostics.",
    "Choose the worked bioequivalence study to run all six canonical R stages, including data/specification exports, same-author QC and number-checked CSR text.",
    "Download the review ZIP with source, inputs, results, actual versions and logs. Changing a setting clears previous results."
